    "testimonial_9UaJdx": {
      "type": "testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_3mFarF": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p><strong>Linda P.</strong></p>",
            "subheading": "Canberra, ACT",
            "text": "<p>I'm a high school design tech teacher and we order from HooknLoop for student projects. The self-adhesive rolls are great because kids can cut exactly what they need. Pricing is reasonable for our budget and they don't mind doing tax invoices for the school which makes purchasing easy. The quality means student projects actually work properly instead of falling apart!</p>",
            "rating": "5",
            "author_image": false
          }
        },
        "testimonial_acUG3c": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p><strong>Tom W.</strong></p>",
            "subheading": "Hobart, TAS",
            "text": "<p>Bought some of the VELCRO brand stuff from HooknLoop for a boat cover repair. Wasn't sure if it'd handle the salt and UV but it's been 8 months and still going strong. Bit more expensive than the generic but worth it for marine use. Arrived in 3 days which saved me missing a weekend trip. Cheers!</p>",
            "rating": "5",
            "author_image": false
          }
        },
        "testimonial_CqWzci": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p><strong>Sarah M.</strong></p>",
            "subheading": "Melbourne, VIC",
            "text": "<p>Been using HooknLoop for our upholstery business for about 18 months now. The adhesive backed stuff is honestly better than what we were getting from our previous supplier at nearly double the price. Sticks properly and the hook side doesn't wear out after a few uses like the cheap rubbish. Fast delivery too which helps when we're in a rush on projects.</p>",
            "rating": "5",
            "author_image": false
          }
        },
        "testimonial_qmUd3y": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p><strong>Dave T.</strong></p>",
            "subheading": "Brisbane, QLD",
            "text": "<p>Ordered the heavy duty straps for cable management in our server room. Absolute game changer! We've tried a few different brands over the years but these HooknLoop ones are genuinely reusable - been opening and closing them for 6 months and they still grip like new. Will definitely be back for more.</p>",
            "rating": "5",
            "author_image": false
          }
        },
        "testimonial_UJfKxU": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p><strong>Jessica L.</strong></p>",
            "subheading": "Sydney, NSW",
            "text": "<p>I make baby carriers and bibs as a small home business, so I go through a fair bit of sew-on hook and loop. HooknLoop's quality is consistent which is really important when you're selling to customers. The 25mm width is perfect for what I need and it washes well without pilling. Customer service helped me work out bulk pricing too which was appreciated.</p>",
            "rating": "5",
            "author_image": false
          }
        },
        "testimonial_ttzrzF": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p><strong>Mark R.</strong></p>",
            "subheading": "Adelaide, SA",
            "text": "<p>Needed some for a DIY camper van conversion project. Bought the adhesive dots for cupboard doors and the back-to-back tape for securing things while driving. Six months of rough Aussie roads and it's all still holding strong. Even the adhesive in the summer heat hasn't failed. Really impressed with HooknLoop's gear.</p>",
            "rating": "5",
            "author_image": false
          }
        },
        "testimonial_LwkzAX": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p><strong>Rachel K.</strong></p>",
            "subheading": "Perth, WA",
            "text": "<p>We use these in our aged care facility for adaptive clothing modifications. The quality is spot on - soft enough for sensitive skin but strong enough to last through commercial laundering. HooknLoop's black sew-on tape doesn't show on dark clothing which the residents appreciate. Been ordering from them for over a year now, never had an issue.</p>",
            "rating": "5",
            "author_image": false
          }
        }
      },
